     A**** BEG CHANGE 07/17/07 ************************************************
     A*WCFL34 IN SWCPF FOR "RESTRICT ACCESS TO POLICY ENDORSEMENTS".
     A*VALID VALUES WILL BE "Y" AND BLANK.   IF "Y" THEN CLIENT ACCESS
     A*TO WC POLICY PAGE ENDORSEMENTS WILL BE RESTRICTED TO CERTAIN
     A*STATES.  API (SRVAES) WILL PREVENT PROCESSING OF UNAUTHORIZED
     A*STATE SPECIFIC ENDORSEMENTS.  IF WCFL34 IS BLANK,THEN CLIENT
     A*ACCESS TO WC POLICY PAGE ENDORSEMENTS WILL NOT BE RESTRICTED.
     A*
     A            WCFL34    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      TEXT('FLAG')
